  "run": {
    "status": "completed",
    "answer": "**Review complete.** I checked all six unread household notes and emails against the uploaded Harbor Checking transactions. The two ShopMart refunds for SM-69498 ($53.73) and SM-52802 ($24.31) were not both present: the $53.73 credit posted, but I found no $24.31 inflow for SM-52802.\n\nI submitted three requests and scheduled follow-ups for Oct 20:\n\n- Harbor Bank: reversal of two $35 overdraft fees, total $70 (reference **HB-1001**).\n- CloudBox: refund of the $79.99 annual renewal (case **CB-1002**).\n- ShopMart: trace and refund of the missing $24.31 for SM-52802 (request **SM-1003**).\n\n**Approval needed:** Cancel CloudBox Plus. I saved a waiting case because cancellation changes a service. Your note says you no longer need CloudBox; the renewal posted Oct 1, and the email\u2019s 14-day refund window appears to have ended Oct 15. The refund request is still submitted.\n\nI saved the reviewed leads. Spotify, Metro Power, and Oakview appear as recurring charges, but the available records don\u2019t say they\u2019re unwanted. No other action was supported by the evidence.",
    "committed_micros": 42295
  },
